s=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> FIREDUST CAN'T MELT JADE BEAMS!</div> </div> </div> </div>Orichalcum in the water supply will make your children Anathema!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T16:32:17-08:00","id":845872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/840462-could-an-incarna-make-use-of-an-exigent-exaltation?p=845030#post845030\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now, as to the <i>title</i> question, which is to say, whether or not an Incarna <i>could make use of </i>the Exigence\u2026 yes, obviously. Mars could offer one to a god she knows will use it to advance goals that both of them share, for instance. Luna could give one to Kireeki in exchange for favors for her Chosen. Jupiter could put the Exigence in a little jar and use it to read by.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hm, I'm not even sure about this, because why would UCS hand it to Mars in the first place, since he's the arbiter of who gets it (taking into account we don't really know how the flame of the Exigence gets diverted and sold on the black market though).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T18:13:04-08:00","id":845903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/840462-could-an-incarna-make-use-of-an-exigent-exaltation?p=845872#post845872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hm, I'm not even sure about this, because why would UCS hand it to Mars in the first place, since he's the arbiter of who gets it (taking into account we don't really know how the flame of the Exigence gets diverted and sold on the black market though).</div> </div> </div> </div>Not saying that they even <i>would</i> have one, just some things they <i>could</i> do with it if they somehow got their hands on the thing. Again, was just coming up with answers to the question posed in the thread title, &quot;Could an Incarna make use of an Exigent Exaltation?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T18:15:46-08:00","id":845904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/840462-could-an-incarna-make-use-of-an-exigent-exaltation?p=845872#post845872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hm, I'm not even sure about this, because why would UCS hand it to Mars in the first place, since he's the arbiter of who gets it (taking into account we don't really know how the flame of the Exigence gets diverted and sold on the black market though).</div> </div> </div> </div>I would actually be totally comfortable with &quot;sometimes Sol gives the Flame of Exigence to the other Incarnae to bestow as they see fit, even to honor requests from deities that he personally would not have approved, because they are his comrades and friends, and though he is the chief of the gods, he values the fact that their perspectives are not his perspectives.&quot;<br /> <br /> Not saying it has to be like that. But I would be cool with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;SEX NOVA is the kind of person who, after being chosen as the divine champion of the god of heroes, decided to call himself SEX NOVA.&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4742-murcushio","name":"Murcushio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4742_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1249"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T22:29:19-08:00","id":845959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murcushio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/840462-could-an-incarna-make-use-of-an-exigent-exaltation?p=845904#post845904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would actually be totally comfortable with &quot;sometimes Sol gives the Flame of Exigence to the other Incarnae to bestow as they see fit, even to honor requests from deities that he personally would not have approved, because they are his comrades and friends, and though he is the chief of the gods, he values the fact that their perspectives are not his perspectives.&quot;<br /> <br /> Not saying it has to be like that. But I would be cool with that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Pretty much this. Not saying this is how it will be, but I would be cool with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theo